    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n6 Glenarm Square is a superb three bedroom, first floor apartment in the ever popular Glenarm Square. Presented in very good condition throughout, the property offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation and will appeal to a wide range of buyers seeking a spacious home in a highly convenient Drumcondra location.\n\nThe accommodation is well laid out and comprises an entrance hall with ample storage space, a generous open-plan living/ dining room, a separate fully fitted kitchen, three well-proportioned bedrooms all with fitted wardrobes, and the shower room completes the picture of this fine home.\nThe apartment is set among beautifully maintained communal gardens and benefits from one underground parking space.\n\nThe location is simply superb, being within walking distance of the city centre and convenient to the numerous shops, cafes, bars and restaurants that Drumcondra Village has to offer. The Botanic Gardens and Griffith Park provide beautiful open green areas. Dublin City University is within easy walking distance, as are a variety of good sports clubs, crèches, primary and secondary schools. The IFSC, Four Courts, King's Inns, the Mater & Bon Secour Hospitals are all within walking distance. Commuting further afield is made very easy with the M50 Motorway, the M1 and Dublin Airport within a few minutes' drive. The area is very well serviced by public transport, through the many bus routes which pass close by and Drumcondra Train Station just a shot walk away.\n\nIf you would like a viewing of this property, please email us at Drumcondra@sherryfitz.ie or call the office directly on 018373737 to arrange an appointment. If you wish to place an offer, please visit www.sherryfitz.ie where you can register to make an offer on this property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.40m x 1.00m\nWelcoming entrance hall with wood flooring, intercom, hot press and storage press.\n\nLiving/ Dining Room - 6.62m x 3.94m\nLarge open plan room with wood flooring, ceiling coving and rose, and electric fireplace.\n\nKitchen - 3.04m x 2.04m\nWith wall and floor units, tiled splashback, oven, four ring ceramic hob, plumbed for washing machine.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.62m x 2.78m\nDouble bedroom with wood flooring and built in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.62m x 2.48m\nDouble bedroom with wood flooring and built in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.62m x 2.12m\nSpacious bedroom with wood flooring and built in wardrobe.\n\nShower Room - 2.00m x 1.92m\nWith tiled floor, wc, wash hand basin, shower and extractor fan.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Spacious three bedroom apartment</li><li>Set on first floor</li><li>Quiet and secure development </li><li>Presented in very good condition</li><li>One underground parking space</li><li>Beautiful communal gardens</li><li>Excellent location close to abundance of amenities</li><li>Short walk to Drumcondra train station</li><li>Management fee 2,217</ul>"
      },
